    "number": "Theorem 2",
    "quote": "For any $a > 1 / \\sqrt{2}$, the expected $n$-round regret of $\\giro$ is bounded from above as R(n) \\leq \\sum_{i = 2}^K \\Delta_i \\Bigg[ \\left(\\frac{16 (2 a + 1) c}{\\Delta_i^2} \\log n + 2\\right) + \\left(\\frac{8 (2 a + 1)}{\\Delta_i^2} \\log n + 2\\right)\\Bigg], where $b = (2 a + 1) / [a (a + 1)]$ and c = \\frac{2 e^2 \\sqrt{2 a + 1}}{\\sqrt{2 \\pi}} \\exp\\left[\\frac{8 b}{2 - b}\\right] \\left(1 + \\sqrt{\\frac{2 \\pi}{4 - 2 b}}\\right) ..."
